<title>ZIMBABWE: TABLE - Zimbabwe June CPI rises to 21.4 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Zimbabwe June CPI rises to 21.4 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe's all-items consumer price index edged up 0.1 percent in June from May, bringing the year-on-year rate to 21.4 percent, the Central Statistical Office said.</p>
<p>				    June 1997   May 1997    June 1996</p>
<p>Year-on-year pct change     +21.4	 +20.7	 +22.5</p>
<p>All-items index		 486.2	 485.8	 400.6</p>
<p>Food-only index		 660.9	 676.6	 525.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Index base 1990=100</p>
<p>-- Harare newsroom: +2634 72 52 27/8/9.</p>
</text>
